# Row A1 status after the Lean round

**Scope.** This round works the A1 lane only (A1a near/far one-loop analysis,
A1b beta-observer contraction). B1/B2/C1/C2 were held, as instructed.

**Toolchain.** There is no Agda executable in this environment, so the existing
`DASHI/Physics/YangMills/BalabanCMP109*` modules cannot be re-checked here, and
no claim is made about them. Following the instruction to reuse or rewrite in
